实话我也很心疼你的遭遇，但我也只是普通人我不是来拯救你的天使","translatedOut":true,"time":"10:30","timestamp":1784601021111,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113524},{"id":1784590871795,"text":"どうしようもありません","sender":"me","translation":"我没办法","translatedOut":true,"time":"10:30","timestamp":1784601024307,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113525},{"id":1784590871796,"text":"恋愛においても、私に感情的な価値を与えてくれる人が必要です。私は厳しい言葉を言い、時には衝動的になり、また敏感になることもあります。","sender":"me","translation":"我谈恋爱也需要有人给我情绪价值，我会说狠话有时候会冲动也会敏感","translatedOut":true,"time":"10:31","timestamp":1784601075606,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113526},{"id":1784590871797,"text":"二人ともこのような状況では、どうやって続けられるのでしょうか","sender":"me","translation":"两个人都这样的话怎么走得下去呢","translatedOut":true,"time":"10:31","timestamp":1784601085425,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113527},{"id":1784590871798,"text":"もう少し大人になってくれませんか？","sender":"me","translation":"拜托成熟一点吧好不好","translatedOut":true,"time":"10:31","timestamp":1784601096604,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113528},{"id":1784590871800,"sender":"them","text":"天使？","timestamp":1784601132150,"tempo":"R","translation":"天使？","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"天使？ || 天使？","roundId":"round_1784601097787_s2joqctnc","userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113529},{"id":1784590871801,"sender":"them","text":"誰がそんなもの求めた？","timestamp":1784601132606,"tempo":"N","translation":"谁求那种东西了？","rawContent":"誰がそんなもの求めた？ || 谁求那种东西了？","roundId":"round_1784601097787_s2joqctnc","userId":"uid_1784289295089_49p53v2oa","characterId":"e07e9de5-949b-4ee7-a5f0-3c06820e8a59","_id":113530},{"id":178459087180